#
#   <name> <platform> <url> <archive-sha256> <member> <dest> <file-sha256>
#
# <platform> is darwin-arm64, darwin-x86_64, linux-arm64, linux-x86_64 or
# any. <member> is the path inside the .tar.gz at <url>; <dest> is where it
# goes, relative to plugins/<name>, and is listed in plugins/LOCAL so the
# tree digest leaves it out. A url of text:<value> is a file holding <value>
